1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,920
天啊 居然有顾客上门
Oh, my God! We have customers?

2
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:07,420
这是怎么回事
What's going on?

3
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,700
怎么来了这么多嬉皮士啊
Why are there so many hipsters here?

4
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,600
我们开始卖傻逼帽子
Are we selling stupid hats and telling them

5
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,160
然后乱夸他们超有才吗
they're more talented than they actually are?

6
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:17,180
不 那种店早有了 就是那家装潮帽店啊
No, that's already a store. It's called "Fedorable."

7
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:21,720
你一直很努力地帮店里招揽顾客
You've been working so hard to get us customers in,

8
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,680
所以我也想找到个方法
I wanted to contribute by finding a way

9
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:24,940
来招揽跟这一带的嬉皮士
to get in the neighborhood hipsters.

10
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:27,060
这就是我们的新传单
So... here's our new flyer.

11
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:30,180
你问都没问我 就弄个新传单啊
You made up a new flyer without talking to me about it first?

12
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:33,240
我给小蛋糕都冠上90年代的名人名呢
I renamed all the cupcakes after people from the '90s!

13
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,440
"麦克斯自制小蛋糕
"Max's Homemade Cupcakes.

14
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:37,620
所有你们要的"口味哥"都有"
We've got all your Flavor Flavs."

15
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:40,760
嬉皮士爱回忆90年代
Hipsters love '90s nostalgia more than they love

16
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:41,900
更胜假装自己啥都不爱
pretending not to love anything.

17
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:44,409
欢迎来舔舔"瘪四"小蛋糕
"Come in and lick a Beavis.

18
00:00:44,409 --> 00:00:47,729
或吃个"大头蛋"
Eat a butt-head."

19
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:51,360
开心果小蛋糕现在改叫"丹尼斯·罗德曼"
The pistachio is now called the Dennis Rodman

20
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:53,040
这蠢蛋糕就得用蠢货的名
because it's such a dumbass flavor.

21
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:54,840
真不错
Cute.

22
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,380
等等 那边怎么回事
Wait, what's going on over there?

23
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:57,860
那些小蛋糕怎么都烂兮兮的
Why are all those cupcakes smashed?

24
00:00:57,860 --> 00:00:59,240
那些是"南茜·克里根"小蛋糕
Those are the Nancy Kerrigans.

25
00:01:00,980 --> 00:01:02,460
拿她的惨事当笑点
I don't know if it's in good taste

26
00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:04,100
会不会有点太无下限啊
to make fun of her personal tragedy.

27
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:06,500
-都卖掉八个了呢 -管她去死 你就是个天才
- I sold eight of them. - Screw her, you're a genius!

28
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:09,040
可以让我也取一个吗
Ooh, ooh, can I name one?

29
00:01:09,460 --> 00:01:11,740
我可以把隔夜的小蛋糕取为"休·海夫纳"吗
How 'bout we call the day-olds the Hugh Hefners?

30
00:01:15,100 --> 00:01:16,160
他又不90年代
That's not '90s.

31
00:01:16,460 --> 00:01:18,480
但他90多岁 如隔夜蛋糕般"又老又硬"
He's in his 90s, and he's stale and hard.

32
00:01:32,980 --> 00:01:35,500
我要外带一个"乔纳森·泰勒·托马斯"
Can I get a Jonathan Taylor Thomas to go

33
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:36,860
再加任意两个"辣妹"
and two of the Spice Girls?

34
00:01:36,860 --> 00:01:39,646
但我不要"宝贝辣妹"哦
Any one but "Baby."

35
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:40,940
没问题
Sure.

36
00:01:41,460 --> 00:01:43,760
兄台 你应该来参加九十年代冷知识大赛
Dude, you should come to the '90s trivia contest

37
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,080
每周一在"酒吧"吧举行哦
every Monday at the Bar bar.

38
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:47,120
你能赢一大笔钱呢
You could win, like, big money.

39
00:01:47,940 --> 00:01:50,360
赢一大笔钱来支付我为了忘掉
Yeah, and then I could pay for the lobotomy I'd need

40
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:51,860
参加过酒吧里的嬉皮士蠢赛
to forget that I ever participated

41
00:01:51,860 --> 00:01:53,400
而去施行的脑部手术吗
in a hipster contest in a bar.

42
00:01:55,220 --> 00:01:56,920
您帽子好有爱 又好有才华哦
Cute hat. You're very talented.

43
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:01,620
我去把这传单贴我们窗子上吧
I'm putting this flyer up in the window.

44
00:02:03,620 --> 00:02:06,420
你看 咱店门口有个街头艺人
Oh, look, there's a street performer trying to get people

45
00:02:06,420 --> 00:02:08,799
想拉路人跟他的牵线木偶跳舞
to dance with his marionette outside our shop.

46
00:02:08,799 --> 00:02:10,998
这可不行
Uh-oh, not cool!

47
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:13,000
嬉皮士才不会想跟木偶跳小丑舞呢
No hipster wants to krump with a puppet.

48
00:02:14,580 --> 00:02:16,160
你看 把客人都吓跑了
See, he just chased them away.

49
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:18,700
我们请他去别地方就行了 要友善哦
We'll just ask him to move, but we have to be nice.

50
00:02:19,060 --> 00:02:20,660
什么友善 友善...
Nice? Nice...

51
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,600
就是趁我妈在卧室藏新买的电视机时
Oh, yeah, that's the thing you are to the welfare lady

52
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:24,500
而我要对那位发补助金的女士装穷扮可怜的样子吗
while your mom's in the bedroom hiding the new TV.

53
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:34,100
您好吗 我们是这小蛋...
Hi, how are you? We own this cupcake--

54
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:37,020
安静 他在跳舞呢
Shh! Not while he's dancing.

55
00:02:43,860 --> 00:02:45,540
抱歉了 您是想我等他跳完吗
I'm sorry, would you like me to wait?

56
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:50,820
这家伙绝对是变态杀人魔
Oh, this dude's a serial killer.

57
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:27,480
您是想我...
Do you want me to...

58
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:35,520
绝对是杀人魔
Yup, total serial killer.

59
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:38,900
我们俩早晚会成为他地下室里的
Just a matter of time till we're hung on strings

60
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:39,760
真人牵线偶
in his basement.

61
00:03:44,220 --> 00:03:46,560
而且我估计还染上了木偶疱疹
And I probably just got puppet herpes.

62
00:03:48,740 --> 00:03:51,460
希望您还喜欢
Well, I hope you enjoyed your kiss

63
00:03:51,460 --> 00:03:53,000
与万人迷皮埃尔的那个吻
with Charming Pierre.

64
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:56,000
如果您赏脸的话...
Now, if you wouldn't mind...

65
00:03:57,380 --> 00:03:58,940
原来皮埃尔是牛郎啊
Oh, Pierre's a prostitute?

66
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:05,580
他在大庭广众之下就"开工" 有点怪吧
It's a little weird for him to do it out in the open,

67
00:04:05,580 --> 00:04:07,420
他要买不起车当"工作站" 那也没办法
but if he can't afford a car, he can't afford a car.

68
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:12,320
看来你是那种没好奇心的无趣女人
Oh, you're one of those-a woman without wonder.

69
00:04:13,940 --> 00:04:16,320
才不是呢 我现在就很好奇
Not true. In fact, I'm wondering

70
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:17,700
你怎么赚得到房租钱
how you manage to pay rent.

71
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:20,520
你们能哪儿凉快哪待去吗
Okay, could you two just move along?

72
00:04:20,540 --> 00:04:22,280
我五分钟后要开始下一场演出了
I have another show in five minutes.

73
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:23,440
那也算是演出啊
That was a show?

74
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:26,660
听好 不许在这表演你的把戏
Look, you can't do your little skits here.

75
00:04:27,140 --> 00:04:28,460
她其实没有负面的意思啦
She doesn't mean to be negative.

76
00:04:28,780 --> 00:04:30,440
她说得对 我本来也打算给点正面评价
She's right. I was planning to be all positive

77
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:31,980
但你的娃娃强奸她腿后就没了
till your doll raped her leg.

78
00:04:34,140 --> 00:04:36,320
皮埃尔不是娃娃好吗
Pierre is not a doll, okay?

79
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:39,380
他是个牵线木偶 我亲手雕刻的呢
He is a marionette. Hand-carved by me.

80
00:04:39,380 --> 00:04:41,280
而且我表演的也不是"把戏" 懂吗
And I don't do "skits," Okay?

81
00:04:41,860 --> 00:04:44,920
我的演出还得到国家的赞助呢
I received a national endowment for my work.

82
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:48,320
什么 政府花钱补助这种玩意儿
What? The government pays for stuff like this,

83
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:49,880
而我连补大牙的钱都没
and I can't get my back tooth fixed?

84
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:53,480
我个人呢 是真的很欣赏
Well, I, for one, really appreciate

85
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:54,680
木偶戏的艺术啦
the art of puppetry.

86
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:56,980
我看得出来 而且...
I can tell you do, and...

87
00:04:56,980 --> 00:04:59,080
皮埃尔也看得出
so can Pierre.

88
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:01,720
他可不会随便亲近人呢
You know, he doesn't just approach anybody.

89
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:05,660
我叫卡洛琳 她是麦克斯 你是...
I'm Caroline. This is Max. And you are?

90
00:05:06,060 --> 00:05:08,240
我的艺名叫"劫佩托"
My stage name is J. Petto.

91
00:05:09,460 --> 00:05:13,080
真有爱 小木偶的爸爸"杰佩托"嘛
Oh, so cute. Geppetto, like Pinocchio's father.

92
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:15,900
不 是"劫"佩托
No, it's "J," period, "Petto."

93
00:05:17,100 --> 00:05:19,080
迪士尼公司有"杰佩托"这名字的版权
Disney owns the rights to the name Geppetto,

94
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:23,100
所以可怜的街头艺人只能屈服于淫威之下啦
so once again, the poor, starving artist gets screwed!

95
00:05:25,780 --> 00:05:28,100
真可怜 你能走吗
So sad. Can you move?

96
00:05:28,540 --> 00:05:30,560
你看 这是我们的小蛋糕店
See, this is our cupcake shop,

97
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,880
你挡住了我们的门口
and you're blocking the entrance.

98
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:33,880
这里是公共区域
Uh, this is a public space,

99
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:34,980
我知道我有哪些公民权利
and I know my rights.

100
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:37,600
表演开始
Showtime!

101
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,940
我刚才一直试着对你友善
I was trying to be nice,

102
00:05:43,960 --> 00:05:46,060
但你是我见过最没礼貌的操偶师
but you are the rudest puppeteer I've ever met.

103
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,580
比莎里·刘易斯这个
And I'm including Shari Lewis,

104
00:05:47,580 --> 00:05:49,760
在我五岁生日派对上 叫我老爸吃屎的人还无礼
who told my father to shove it on my fifth birthday!

105
00:05:49,980 --> 00:05:50,820
走吧 麦克斯
Let's go, Max.

106
00:05:53,900 --> 00:05:56,400
喂 娃娃男
Hey... Doll man.

107
00:05:57,220 --> 00:05:58,880
惹龙惹凤也别惹我们
You don't want to mess with us.

108
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:00,700
我给警察打个电话
I make one call to the cops,

109
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:03,181
他们调查一下你的背景 我肯定很快
they do a background check, and I'm pretty sure you'd go

110
00:06:03,181 --> 00:06:06,234
就能查出你恋童癖的事哦
from "J. Petto" to "J. Petto-Phile."

111
00:06:09,540 --> 00:06:11,420
小姐 我把"大卫·霍索夫"弄掉地上了
Miss, I dropped my David Hasselhoff.

112
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:13,560
这也不是他第一次倒在地上了
Well, it's not the first time he's been on the floor.

113
00:06:14,980 --> 00:06:17,240
不许你这么说我
Hey, you can't talk to me like that.

114
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:19,820
我曾经就学于巴黎学习木偶艺术...
I studied puppetry in Paris at the palais--

115
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:25,640
天啊 他踩到"大卫·霍索夫" 滑倒了
Oh, my God, he slipped on David Hasselhoff!

116
00:06:26,220 --> 00:06:27,220
-你没事吧 -没事
- Are you okay? - Yeah.

117
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,920
我没事 没事啦
Yeah, I'm fine, I'm fine.

118
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,540
觉得有点丢脸而已
I'm just a little embarrassed.

119
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:35,120
惨了 惨了 我压在皮埃尔身上了
Oh, no, no. I landed on Pierre!

120
00:06:36,180 --> 00:06:36,700
皮埃尔
Pierre?

121
00:06:38,220 --> 00:06:39,600
来 请坐
Here, have a seat.

122
00:06:39,820 --> 00:06:42,200
你要喝杯咖啡还是来个免费小蛋糕吗
Would either of you like a coffee or a free cupcake?

123
00:06:42,420 --> 00:06:46,040
不用 我收拾一下就走 谢谢
No, I'm just gonna pack up and go. Thank you.

124
00:06:46,300 --> 00:06:48,520
随时欢迎回来吃免费小蛋糕
Come back anytime for a free cupcake.

125
00:06:48,660 --> 00:06:49,840
不过娃娃就不必带着了
But no need to bring your dolls.

126
00:06:51,100 --> 00:06:54,160
这不是娃娃好吗 我是个男人
They're not dolls! I'm a man!

127
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:04,080
我们的新传单发出去后
It's crazy how many hipsters

128
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:06,080
今天来店里光顾的嬉皮士超级多
came into our shop today from our new flyers.

129
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:07,840
而且店里所有的
We ran completely out of all

130
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:10,114
花生巧克力小蛋糕"巴特福奥克"
the Butterfinger Buttafuocos,

131
00:07:10,114 --> 00:07:12,260
"乔伊"版"以及我本来以为卖不掉的
the Joeys, and even the Mary Jos,

132
00:07:12,260 --> 00:07:13,900
"玛丽·乔"版 都统统卖光了呢
which I did not think would sell.

133
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:16,860
我把"南茜·克里根"重弄了一下
I reworked the smashed Nancy Kerrigans

134
00:07:16,860 --> 00:07:17,820
然后改叫它"玛丽·乔"
and called it the Mary Jo.

135
00:07:19,780 --> 00:07:22,380
姑娘们 我真替你们开心
Girls, I'm so happy for you.

136
00:07:23,100 --> 00:07:25,260
我还记得我生意
You know, I remember when my business

137
00:07:25,260 --> 00:07:27,080
刚开始蒸蒸日上那会
first started to take off.

138
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:29,680
我第一件事就是把我长大的那小村子
The first thing I did was to buy the little village

139
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:31,140
给买了下来
that I grew up in

140
00:07:31,140 --> 00:07:33,620
然后一把火把它烧成灰烬
and then burn it to the ground!

141
00:07:35,820 --> 00:07:37,360
我恨死他们
I was just so angry

142
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:39,100
当年不让我加入拉拉队了
they wouldn't let me be a cheerleader.

143
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:42,780
宝贝 那是电影《卡丽》的情节啦
No, baby, that was the movie Carrie.

144
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:44,780
你昨晚看的时候睡着了
You fell asleep watching it last night.

145
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:49,860
我以后不深夜看电影了
Oh. Yeah, I gotta stop watching movies late at night.

146
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,420
我因为这样 有一年
Once, for a whole year,

147
00:07:51,420 --> 00:07:53,400
我以为是我陷害的兔子罗杰呢
I thought I framed Roger Rabbit.

148
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:03,140
我想找麦克斯自制小蛋糕的店主
I'm looking for the owners of Max's homemade cupcakes.

149
00:08:03,580 --> 00:08:05,980
是我 真是名声传千里啊
Oh, that's me. Wow, word is really spreading.

150
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,080
有什么需要帮忙的吗
How can I help you?

151
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:07,980
你被传唤了
You've been served.

152
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:11,400
麦克斯 我被法院传唤[羞辱]了
Max, I just got served.

153
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:13,660
羞辱你的刘海吗 我肯定先从这开始羞辱起
Did he go after your bangs? 'Cause that's where I'd start.

154
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:16,080
这可是法律诉讼啊
This is a lawsuit.

155
00:08:16,520 --> 00:08:18,780
上面写着 "麦隆·谢尔斯 也就是劫佩托
It says, "Max's homemade cupcakes is being sued

156
00:08:18,780 --> 00:08:21,700
因在麦克斯自制小蛋糕店摔伤 而以
for injuries sustained in our shop by Myron Shales,

157
00:08:21,700 --> 00:08:23,857
故意伤害罪起诉店主"
A.K.A. 'J. Petto.'"

158
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:25,500
麦克斯 是那个木偶男
Max, it's the puppet guy.

159
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:27,040
他要告咱们啊
He's suing us?

160
00:08:27,260 --> 00:08:29,580
应该是我们告他很恶心...
We should be suing him for gross...

161
00:08:29,580 --> 00:08:31,440
我不知道法律用词怎么说
I don't know what the legal words are

162
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:32,380
反正就是告他当个恶心人啦
but just for being gross.

163
00:08:33,460 --> 00:08:34,940
我们承受不起被人告
We can't afford to be sued.

164
00:08:34,940 --> 00:08:37,000
