他有女朋友的 她叫露露
He had a girlfriend named Lulu.

353
00:17:30,900 --> 00:17:33,460
她曾是...法国国王的宫廷名妓
She was a--she was a courtesan in the court of a french king.

354
00:17:33,700 --> 00:17:35,880
他们之所以分手 是因为露露跟伊薇特调情
They broke up over a brief flirtation she had with Yvette.

355
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:39,840
我知道他们不是活人
And I know they're not alive!

356
00:17:41,100 --> 00:17:44,860
我们就遵守原本没附加条件约定 你看如何
Now, what do you say we stick to the original no-strings deal?

357
00:17:45,340 --> 00:17:46,920
因为如果你不愿意 麦克斯会让你见识下
'cause if you don't, Max will show you

358
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:48,740
什么是真正的"没有线"[附加]
what "no strings" really means.

359
00:17:49,600 --> 00:17:51,640
剪啊 来啊 有种你就剪断它
Do it! Go! Bring it!

360
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:56,100
反正我能重新绑 我可是这门手艺的大师
I can always re-string him. I'm a master of my craft.

361
00:17:56,540 --> 00:17:58,560
没错 我们早知道你会这么说
Yes, we thought you'd say that.

362
00:17:58,600 --> 00:18:00,597
你让我们别无选择 麦克斯
So you leave us no choice. Max...

363
00:18:00,597 --> 00:18:02,860
什么 我...
What? I--

364
00:18:02,860 --> 00:18:04,940
我不会改变主意的
I'm not changing my mind.

365
00:18:04,940 --> 00:18:07,420
我要去找警察来
And I'm coming back with the police.

366
00:18:09,360 --> 00:18:12,080
是我就不会叫警察哦
Oh, I wouldn't get the cops involved...

367
00:18:12,080 --> 00:18:14,760
因为你的小娃娃现在...
Now that your boy here is in a...

368
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:16,840
抓奸在床 进退两难啊
compromising situation!

369
00:18:33,620 --> 00:18:36,340
你好大的胆子
How dare you!

370
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:40,080
她做爱时可不喜欢戴套哦
And she does not like the feel of a condom!

371
00:18:42,400 --> 00:18:44,800
你们俩变态
You two are sick!

372
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:47,800
我们才不会批评他们
Hey, we don't judge.

373
00:18:48,140 --> 00:18:50,500
我们觉得无论这两名成年娃娃
We think whatever two consenting dolls,

374
00:18:50,500 --> 00:18:53,600
或这三名成年娃娃做什么...
or maybe three consenting dolls do--

375
00:18:54,820 --> 00:18:56,442
我肯定场面不会好看
and it's gonna be bad

376
00:18:56,442 --> 00:18:59,219
他可是不硬则小 一硬惊人哦
'cause he's a grower, not a shower.

377
00:19:04,520 --> 00:19:07,940
一旦这些照片放上网
And once a few of these pics are posted online,

378
00:19:07,940 --> 00:19:10,380
你儿童派对的生意也会跟着完蛋
there goes your children's party business.

379
00:19:11,040 --> 00:19:14,220
现在认输 我就把照片全删了
Now, call it quits, and you can delete these pics.

380
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:16,820
好 我认 你们赢了 你们赢了
Fine. Yes. Okay, you win. You win. You win.

381
00:19:17,220 --> 00:19:19,780
口说无凭 我们不会再上当受骗了
Oh, we're not falling for your word again.

382
00:19:20,040 --> 00:19:22,120
如果你想要回你的娃娃
If you want your doll back--

383
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:24,960
再说最后一遍 他不是娃娃
For the last time, he is not a doll!

384
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:27,640
我们要收到公证过的信件
Bring us a notarized letter saying

385
00:19:27,640 --> 00:19:29,220
写明你放弃对麦克斯自制小蛋糕店
you release Max's homemade cupcakes

386
00:19:29,220 --> 00:19:31,000
采取进一步的法律行动
of all further legal action,

387
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:33,280
然后我们就会把皮埃尔原封不动地还给你
and we'll give you back Pierre, perfectly intact.

388
00:19:33,480 --> 00:19:35,000
当然 童贞还不了了
Minus his virginity, of course.

389
00:19:36,820 --> 00:19:39,580
不过别担心 你的童贞一定还在
But don't worry, you'll still have yours.

390
00:19:41,260 --> 00:19:43,559
好的 我会尽快回来的
Okay, I'll be back as soon as I can.

391
00:19:43,559 --> 00:19:47,164
在残酷的木偶界混了三十年
Ugh, 30 years in the cutthroat world of puppets,

392
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:51,220
居然栽在两个卖蛋糕的疯婆子手上
and I'm undone by two crazy cupcake bitches!

393
00:19:56,500 --> 00:19:59,460
你听到了吗 三十年啊
Did you hear that? 30 years?

394
00:20:00,180 --> 00:20:03,140
追梦整整三十年 他还是一无所有
30 years of following his dream, and he's still broke?

395
00:20:03,240 --> 00:20:04,640
我们也会这样吗 麦克斯
Is that gonna be us, Max?

396
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:06,660
我们的梦想跟木偶一样愚蠢吗
Is our dream just as stupid as puppets?

397
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:09,080
抱歉 皮埃尔 忘了你还在
Sorry, Pierre, I forgot you were here.

398
00:20:09,820 --> 00:20:10,900
他好像睡着了
He's sound asleep.

399
00:20:11,280 --> 00:20:12,360
"三人行"把他的体力榨干了
Three-ways really take it out of you.

400
00:20:13,760 --> 00:20:15,040
给 帮她把衣服穿上 她得打车走人了
Here, dress her. She has to get a cab.

401
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:16,440
她宁愿回家睡自己的床
She'd rather sleep in her own bed.

402
00:20:20,540 --> 00:20:22,700
你知道为什么我们不会变成他那样吗
And do you know why we're not gonna turn into him?

403
00:20:22,960 --> 00:20:25,280
因为30年前 当劫佩托说
Because 30 years ago, when J. Petto said,

404
00:20:25,440 --> 00:20:26,560
"我要成为一名操偶师"时
"I'm gonna be a puppeteer,"

405
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:28,280
