he didn't have a best friend to tell him,

406
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:30,260
"你不该这样 这主意蠢透了"
"You shouldn't do that. It's a stupid idea."

407
00:20:31,060 --> 00:20:32,880
你不像他 你有我来告诉你
And unlike him, you have me to tell you

408
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:33,840
哪些是蠢主意
when it's a stupid idea.

409
00:20:33,860 --> 00:20:36,080
而你也会告诉我 不要用狼牙棒打自己
And I have you to tell me not to mace myself,

410
00:20:36,080 --> 00:20:37,880
尽管我超级想试试是什么感觉
no matter how bad I want to know how it feels.

411
00:20:39,420 --> 00:20:41,600
那蛋糕店不是蠢主意吗
So the cupcake shop isn't a stupid idea?

412
00:20:41,860 --> 00:20:44,020
不是 而且生意刚要好转呢
No. And it's actually starting to take off.

413
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:46,300
因为蠢主意什么的 最合嬉皮士胃口了
'cause no one embraces a stupid idea like a hipster.

414
00:20:47,520 --> 00:20:49,100
但麦克斯 我们真需要买保险了
But, Max, we do need insurance.

415
00:20:49,580 --> 00:20:51,100
-可我们有钱买吗 -没有
- But do we have the money? - No.

416
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:52,920
那别人在店里摔倒的几率是多少
What are the chances someone else is gonna fall?

417
00:20:53,160 --> 00:20:53,840
百万分之一
A million to one.

418
00:20:54,300 --> 00:20:55,400
我喜欢这种几率
I like those odds.

419
00:20:56,680 --> 00:20:58,320
这个裙子真可爱
You know, this is a really cute dress.

420
00:20:58,860 --> 00:20:59,860
裙子算屁啊
Forget the dress.

421
00:21:00,100 --> 00:21:01,440
你看他的小裤裤
Look at his cute pants.

422
00:21:01,900 --> 00:21:03,500
我们真应该送给阿憨穿
We really should give them to Han.
